OL,4,G1000FThe Beth Ditto Show
OL,5,     GBeth's back for round two with
OL,6,     Gmusical gems new and old, plus a
OL,7,     GCaffeine Kick at 11!
OL,8,G1300FZakia
OL,9,     GZakia sits in for Jamz and chats
OL,10,     Gto Ego Ella May about her new
OL,11,     Galbum Good Intentions. They talk
OL,12,     Gabout the making of the record,
OL,13,     Gthemes running through it and
OL,14,     Gmore.
OL,15,G1500FGilles Peterson
OL,16,     GGilles invites Ezra Collective's
OL,17,     Gdrummer, Femi Koleoso, and
OL,18,     Gsaxophonist Courtney Pine into
OL,19,     Gthe studio to celebrate two
OL,20,     Gmilestones in British jazz.
